# Files Vercel must NOT upload. Everything uploaded outside api/ is served as a
# public static file (until 2026-10-24, /CLAUDE.md, the prompt histories,
# docs/ and scripts/ were readable by anyone).
#
# Before adding a folder here, check that nothing under api/ imports from it
# (e.g. lib/ is imported by api/v4/ami-scan.js, so it stays).

